==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Shy Boy]] (200%) spawns.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Shy Boy]] (1,000%) spawns.
**1 [[Shy Boy]] (1,000%) spawns.

==Strategy==
Be prepared to spam your meatshields to prevent the Shy Boys from damaging your base too much. It is recommended to use [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] to knockback the Shy Boys and then subsequently spam [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] and [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating]] cats.

Alternatively, you can try and stall the first Shy Boy with a high enough leveled [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] and [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]], and save up for [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] by getting money from killing the Doge Darks through using a unit like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] or [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Hip Hop Cat]], but not pushing too far in the process. When the [[Enemy Bases|enemy base]] is hit, spam everything you have.

